+5. Your MAILER subscription and registration
+5. Your MAILER subscription and registration
+5. Your MAILER subscription and registration
0                  ______
+  Distribution of MAILER updates was formerly based on  a  subscription  in
0the  node information database maintained by the BITNET Network Information
0Center (BITNIC).  This same database is used to register the  existence  of
0      ______
+your  MAILER  virtual  machine  so  that  other mailers know about it.  The
0        _            _                          ______
+":informX" and ":infoX" tags were used for your MAILER subscription.    The
0                                           ______
+":mailer"   tag   registers  your  node's  MAILER.    Updated  registration
0                                                           "XMAILER  NAMES"
+                                                           "XMAILER  NAMES"
+information is distributed once monthly by BITNIC in  the  "XMAILER  NAMES"
0file (see section 4).
0
0                                                   ______
+  The ":mailer" tag is still used to register your MAILER, but Eric Thomas'
0                                                                     ______
+Revised  LISTSERV  is  now  the  system  used  to  maintain   your   MAILER
0subscription.    All  previously ":info/:inform"-subscribed users have been
0moved to LISTSERV.
0
