+9. MAILER User Exits and MAILER TXTLIB
+9. MAILER User Exits and MAILER TXTLIB
+9. MAILER User Exits and MAILER TXTLIB
0                                                            ______
+  The  commonly  used  user  exit  programs  are built into MAILER.  Others
0                                                               ______
+reside  in  MAILER  TXTLIB  and  are  dynamically  loaded  by  MAILER  when
0referenced in one of the tables at initialization.
