 9.1.5. NOMAIL
+9.1.5. NOMAIL
+9.1.5. NOMAIL
0  This type 2 exit is used for RSCS nodes that can't handle mail.  It  logs
0an  error  message  and  causes  the  mail  to  be  returned.  The required
0parameter is the host name to give in the error mail.  It sends  mail  back
0                                         _________
+that essentially says, "Mail service for parameter is not available."
