0domain-style recipient address (i.e. without dots) to be returned with  the
0error  "Unknown  Host"  rather  than  attempting  to send the mail via RSCS
0(which will generally result in returned mail unless  RSCS  knows  of  some
0                ______
+node names that MAILER doesn't).
0
