0Cornell  CARD  utility  (which has been supplied to you).  To install a new
0"MAILER  MODULE",  simply  rename  the  old  "MAILER  MODULE"  (for  backup
0                                             ______
+purposes), CARD LOAD the new one and restart MAILER.
0
0  TEXT  files  are sent out as replacements for members of "MAILER TXTLIB".
